## Acting or moving in the direction opposite to the usual direction of movement.
##: {{syn|en|retrograde}}
##: {{ux|en|The occasional apparent '''backward''' movement of planets is evidence that they revolve around the sun.}}
##: {{ux|en|Engage the lock to prevent '''backward''' rotation of the wheel.}}
## {{lb|en|figuratively}} Acting or moving oppositely to the desired direction of progress.
##: {{ux|en|This is a '''backward''' step for the country.}}
