{{root|en|ine-pro|*sekʷ-|id=follow}}
From {{inh|en|enm|associat|alt=associat(e)}} (used [[participially]] as well as [[adjectively]] up to {{w|Early Modern English}}), from {{der|en|la|associātus|nocat=1}}, the {{glossary|perfect}} {{glossary|passive}} {{glossary|participle}} of {{m|la|associō||to join, unite}}, from {{af|la|ad-|sociō|nocat=1}}, from {{af|la|socius|-ō|t1=shared, common, kindred|id2=denominative|pos2=first conjugation verb-forming suffix|nocat=1}}.

====Adjective====
